<characters>
  <character>
    <name>Tom</name>
    <metatype>Shapeshifter</metatype>
    <background>Jaguar shapeshifter and assasin.  Goes by whatever the slang for a male cat is wherever he happens to be working.  Personality lifted straight from Zevran in Dragon Age.  Completely shallow, hits on anything of either gender that moves, and is really, really dangerous in combat.  Plays with wounded enemies like a cat would.  Motivated entirely by money, ass, and  good seafood.  Use for comic relief and a heavy hitter to help/hinder the players as needed.</background>
